If a wand makes an engraving vanish, then do the following steps:
1) Get a dagger (or any other weapon that can dull).
2) Engrave with the dagger until it is completely dull.
3) Drop the dagger on the ground.
4) Zap the dagger with the wand.

If the dagger disappears, then the wand is teleportation.
If the dagger does not disappear, then try engraving with it.  If you
can engrave with it, then the wand is cancellation.  If you can't
engrave with it, then the wand is make invisible.


